      "Create an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) cluster with the Amazon EC2 launch type. Configure Amazon S3 event notifications to send messages to an Amazon SQS queue, and configure ECS container tasks to continuously poll the queue, update DynamoDB, and forward failed items to a dead-letter queue.",
      "Deploy a worker environment using AWS Elastic Beanstalk backed by an Auto Scaling group of EC2 instances. Configure an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic subscribed to S3 bucket events to forward tasks to the Beanstalk worker queue, and configure a dead-letter queue for failed tasks.",
      "Deploy a document processing application on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). Configure an Amazon EventBridge rule to periodically inspect the S3 bucket, process pending files, write records to DynamoDB, and send errors to an SQS queue."
