      "Schedule automated Amazon RDS snapshots every 30 minutes, and implement an AWS Lambda function to automatically restore the snapshot into a different Availability Zone upon detecting an outage.",
      "Deploy an Amazon RDS cross-Region read replica in a secondary AWS Region. Configure an Amazon Route 53 failover routing policy to redirect database queries to the secondary Region during an outage."
