      "Create a standard Amazon S3 bucket. Have the mobile application request presigned URLs from an authentication backend to upload replay archives directly to the S3 bucket using the standard regional endpoint. Process the archives using an Auto Scaling group of Amazon EC2 Spot Instances configured with static AWS access keys stored in the EC2 instance user data to authenticate access to the S3 bucket.",
