      "Configure the Auto Scaling group to use Spot Instances for the 24/7 baseline capacity, and launch On-Demand Instances to handle peak exam traffic. Upgrade the primary Amazon RDS DB instance to a larger instance class with Provisioned IOPS (io2) storage to handle the increased query load.",
      "Purchase 3-year Standard Reserved Instances for EC2 to cover the maximum anticipated peak exam capacity. Modify the Amazon RDS DB instance to a Single-AZ deployment to lower database costs, and deploy an Amazon ElastiCache for Redis cluster to cache database query results."
