      "Deploy the application on Amazon EC2 instances in a single Availability Zone behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). Purchase 1-year All Upfront Reserved Instances to cover the peak capacity requirement. Configure an Amazon CloudWatch alarm to vertically resize the instances to larger instance types when traffic surges occur.",
      "Deploy the application on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group across multiple Availability Zones behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). Purchase Compute Savings Plans to cover the steady-state baseline usage, and configure a target tracking scaling policy to automatically add On-Demand Instances during traffic surges."
